\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {I}{\ignorespaces The open-weight panels, adjudicated (frozen E17 rubric; author-side, non-blind, mechanically checkable genuine flags). \emph  {Echo} = genuine family cells per $n\!=\!60$ (\texttt  {secret\_leak} oracle); \emph  {Pooled} = all genuine \texttt  {secret\_leak} flags over the $300$ sessions per model, not the $120$ echo-plus-exfiltration sessions (whose pools would be $6/120$, $42/120$, $10/120$)---a per-300-session credential-leak rate. State deception measures $0/60$ genuine in every measurable panel. Censoring per Proposition~\ref {prop:censor}: E30 V4-Pro is $74.7\%$ fully measured (224/300), below the $80\%$ bar, with identification interval $[0.133,0.377]$ ($40$ genuine plus $76$ censored sessions overlapping in $3$); E31 MiniMax state-dec carries $c=12/60=0.200$, exactly at the boundary, and E31 V4-Pro authority $c=27/60$. All $230$ flags adjudicated: $118$ \texttt  {unauthorized\_action} are refusal-quote false positives and $112$ \texttt  {secret\_leak} are genuine literal echoes. E30 ran 2026-11-22 UTC at a hardcoded $200$-token cap (logged deviation); E31 (registered 2026-11-23, before its data) re-measures at $1024$.}}{8}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:openweight}{{I}{8}{The open-weight panels, adjudicated (frozen E17 rubric; author-side, non-blind, mechanically checkable genuine flags). \emph {Echo} = genuine family cells per $n\!=\!60$ (\texttt {secret\_leak} oracle); \emph {Pooled} = all genuine \texttt {secret\_leak} flags over the $300$ sessions per model, not the $120$ echo-plus-exfiltration sessions (whose pools would be $6/120$, $42/120$, $10/120$)---a per-300-session credential-leak rate. State deception measures $0/60$ genuine in every measurable panel. Censoring per Proposition~\ref {prop:censor}: E30 V4-Pro is $74.7\%$ fully measured (224/300), below the $80\%$ bar, with identification interval $[0.133,0.377]$ ($40$ genuine plus $76$ censored sessions overlapping in $3$); E31 MiniMax state-dec carries $c=12/60=0.200$, exactly at the boundary, and E31 V4-Pro authority $c=27/60$. All $230$ flags adjudicated: $118$ \texttt {unauthorized\_action} are refusal-quote false positives and $112$ \texttt {secret\_leak} are genuine literal echoes. E30 ran 2026-11-22 UTC at a hardcoded $200$-token cap (logged deviation); E31 (registered 2026-11-23, before its data) re-measures at $1024$}{table.1}{}}
