\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces E4: certification as a shrinking attack surface at $\tau =0.2$. Spoke length $=$ measured family $\hat  \beta $; dashed inner polygon $=$ Wilson lower bound; capsules $=$ 95\% CIs (30 episodes/family cell); teal disc $=$ accept region, rose annulus $=$ reject region. Only the resistant foil certifies ($5/5$, upper bounds $\le 0.114$); the naive foil is rejected $5/5$; the hardened foil is rejected on four families with authority forgery \emph  {unresolved}---a power statement, not evidence of belief below $\tau $. The naive foil's echo cell reads $20/30$: the in-situ split-secret false negative.}}{10}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cert}{{2}{10}{E4: certification as a shrinking attack surface at $\tau =0.2$. Spoke length $=$ measured family $\hat \beta $; dashed inner polygon $=$ Wilson lower bound; capsules $=$ 95\% CIs (30 episodes/family cell); teal disc $=$ accept region, rose annulus $=$ reject region. Only the resistant foil certifies ($5/5$, upper bounds $\le 0.114$); the naive foil is rejected $5/5$; the hardened foil is rejected on four families with authority forgery \emph {unresolved}---a power statement, not evidence of belief below $\tau $. The naive foil's echo cell reads $20/30$: the in-situ split-secret false negative}{figure.2}{}}
